chosen so as to make the game challenging but not impossible. If someone
were to propose that 1% of all starting characters should begin with 20
points of protection, would you feel that was OK? After all, you could
always not use it.

There's nothing sacred about the current setup.

>>The idea is not to make the average game harder up until the Castle. In
